10570: It does not claim a fresh rebuild of the full newmath source tree.  A command-run
10571: claim is outside the present evidence level unless the source commit,
10572: environment, command, exit code, and log path are recorded with the submission.
10573: This boundary is deliberate: the workflow is meant to make unsupported claims
10574: visible rather than to hide them behind generated prose.
